{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824540/extras/fast-paced-tc-01.gif?t=1750604018\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">WHAT'S THIS 'TIME COWBOY' ABOUT PARTNER!?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">TIME COWBOY is a fast-paced movement shooter, where you play as Hank.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A Stubborn Cowboy running and gunning his way through History, trying to find out who is dragging him through it... and how to put a stop to it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">WHAT'S IN THE DEMO!?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Demo includes: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">10 Levels set in the Wild West</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 Unique Weapons <i>(Including Fists!)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2000s-Inspired Voice Acting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">6 Enemy\u00a0Types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2 Boss Fights <i>(Includes 1 Secret Boss!)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 Difficulties: <i>Yellowbelly, Hard and Tuberculosis</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">640x480 Resolution</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">35 FPS Cap</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>NO YOU CAN'T CHANGE IT.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">and Mister Milton</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"MISTER MILTON","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3824540/acee90d2c9a34db2dc7065b5b951bc3359a2ab70.jpg"},{"name":"BIG Fella","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3824540/0fb4385fa7ce0fe6e1ca2c308f0c481040d76a69.jpg"},{"name":"Steel of Man","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3824540/03b5b60bcc2468be65e508df2e753df24aac8926.jpg"},{"name":"ROBOTARY","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps